Package: addins.qmd
Type: Package
Title: RStudio Add-ins for Quarto Documents
Version: 0.0.1
Date: 2022-08-03  
Authors@R: person("Vilmantas", "Gegzna",
                  email = "GegznaV@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre","cph")
            )
Description: Package `addins.qmd` contains RStudio add-ins to format Quarto
             documents. The main purpose of this package is to help beginners
             learn Quarto and Pandoc Markdown syntax faster and use keyboard
             shortcuts for common authoring elements.
URL: https://gegznav.github.io/addins.qmd/
